  <h2>Radical Transparency in the Supply Chain</h2>
  <p>Distance should not mean uncertainty. As your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we have implemented a digital tracking system that gives you a window into our Guangzhou and Yiwu facilities.</p>

  <h3>Phase-Gate Visibility</h3>
  <p>From the moment your fabric enters the dyeing vat to the final stitch on the packing line, every phase is logged. This data-driven approach allows for precise <strong>Inventory Management</strong>, enabling you to market your "Coming Soon" collections with absolute date confidence.</p>

  <h3>Streamlined Global Logistics</h3>
  <p>Our digital platform syncs directly with <strong>Global Logistics</strong> partners. The moment your order clears final QC, the shipping documentation is generated automatically, reducing manual processing time by 48 hours and getting your goods to the UK or USA faster than ever.</p>
